==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Manager Cat & Clerk Cat (Enemy)|Manager Cat & Clerk Cat]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

